---
/**
 * Accessible skip link per §10.
 * Directly targets #main on keyboard focus.
 */
---
<a
  href="#main"
  class="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-50 focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:bg-[var(--accent-signal)] focus:text-[var(--bg-page)] focus:font-semibold focus:rounded-[4px] focus:shadow-lg focus:outline-none"
>
  Skip to main content
</a>
